<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  1.02 %		    C/S =  2.55 % (Discount)</p>
<p>	   O/N =  2.55 %		    O/N =  5.10 % (Discount)</p>
<p>	   T/N =  0.85 %		    T/N =  1.27 % (Discount)</p>
<p>		   April 30, 1997		    April 29, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  1.70 %     1 month forward =  1.02 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.72 %     2 month forward =  2.21 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.52 %     3 month forward =  3.29 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  4.17 %     4 month forward =  3.91 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  4.35 %     5 month forward =  4.35 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  4.31 %     6 month forward =  4.36 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
